    "profileImage": "/app/_assets/images/profile.jpg",
    "mainContent": "Hi, I'm Idriss, a front-end web developer specializing in React and e-commerce with four years of experience. I love turning ideas into fast, scalable, and intuitive web experiences. With expertise in Remix.run, Webflow, and Squarespace, I build high-performance platforms that look great and run smoothly.\n\n Beyond front-end, I'm expanding my full-stack skills to launch indie SaaS projects and share insights on Twitter. I thrive on problem-solving and optimization, ensuring integrations work seamlessly with minimal maintenance. Right now, I'm seeking new opportunities to push web development further.\n\n Let's build something great together.",
    "additionalContent": "I'm a software developer with a passion for building web applications. I'm a quick learner and I'm always looking to improve my skills.",
